    "all_open_lower_bound": "Every current store and every vector of independent final snapshots/written sets can be constructed with all transactions open and missed sets empty; labeled subfamily cardinality (V+1)^K * (V+2)^(K*T).",
    "false": "AtMostOneConflict revises only the invariant and has a depth-eight independently validated counterexample."
  },
